        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka maraika w'obugabe bwa Buperesi amazire ebiro makumi abiri na kimwe ankumiriire; bwanyima Mikaeli, omwe ahari baamaraika abakuru, yaija kumpa emikono; ntyo naamutsigaho n'ogwo mukuru w'obugabe bwa Buperesi, ",
          "type": "text",
